  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Playin' In The Bad Reprise**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **gd1979-10-24.145372.fob.nak700.rolfe.miller.clugston.flac1648** (recommended): audience recording; 20 songs; 151 min; rated 2/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer says the Dead played Niagara Falls only once, at the Convention Center in 1984, so this show's title is wrong [3]\n- The reviewer attended this as their first Dead show [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd1979-10-24.145372.fob.nak700.rolfe.miller.clugston.flac1648**: taped by Steve Rolfe; transferred by Scott Clugston and Charlie Miller; source: Steve Rolfe's Master (FOB) Audience Cassettes; Nakamichi 700 mics > Sony D5 [1]. Also: A 12-second patch in this song comes from a Sennheiser blend source by Rob Eaton and Charlie Miller [1]",
